abstract: >
  A production-grade Regional Economic Analysis Agent (REA) with v9.0
  Python SDK + Typer CLI (11 sub-commands, 3 output formats) and v9.1
  Web Console (13 HTML pages, SSE chat, 9 analytics tools, ECharts
  dashboards). Covers 10 major Chinese cities with 4 analysis scenarios
  (city comparison, retail site selection, sales forecasting, government
  industry-policy evaluation) plus an AI chat assistant powered by
  LiteLLM (OpenAI / Anthropic / Ollama). Backend built with FastAPI,
  pandas, scikit-learn, statsmodels; frontend uses ECharts and a
  custom CSS design-token system.
